:: start default
> intro_line
  Intro line.
! immediate intro_sfx()
? ask_work
  Ask about work.
  -> work
? locked requires=(trusts(player))
  Take the locked route.
  -> locked

:: work
! deferred finished_work()
! blocking grant_item(map)
? end_now
  End now.
  -> END

:: locked
> locked_line
  Locked route reached.
-> END
